{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54533","headline":"兵要望江南 占云第三（京本作「占云第二十四○二十六首」） 二十 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占云第三（京本作「占云第二十四○二十六首」） 二十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"壬癸日，云忌暗（京本作「色」）而黄。\n此兆主灾军（京本作「兵」）将损（辛本、川本作「迎老将」），无缘兵广恣猖狂，谋者审（京本作「贵密」）而详。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54533.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54533","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}